   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a quotient with numerator \\( \\sqrt{1 + \\sin(4x)} \\) and denominator \\( 5^{x} \\), so the quotient rule comes first (equivalently, rewrite \\( f \\) as a product with the factor \\( 5^{-x} \\)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Sqrt",
               [
                  "Add",
